Ported terminal renderer
========================

`sources/terminal/` contains code ported from Paseo
(https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Copyright (c) 2025-present Mohamed Boudra

Files derived from Paseo, and what changed on the way in:

  headlessTerminalState.ts    Scrollback extraction removed; the snapshot a
                              client replays already carries the screen.
  terminalRowModel.ts         Cell selection removed.
  terminalColors.ts           Theme comes from terminalTheme.ts instead of the
                              Paseo design system.
  terminalCustomGlyph.ts      Unchanged.
  terminalGridMetrics.ts      Unchanged.
  terminalSizeMeasurement.ts  Unchanged.
  terminalKeyEvents.ts        Unchanged.
  terminalGridView.tsx        Selection removed; Paseo's Unistyles replaced
                              with React Native's StyleSheet.
  terminalInput.tsx           Paseo's EditingTextInput replaced with a plain
                              TextInput; the Android remeasure machinery is
                              unnecessary for a 1x1 hidden field.
  terminalKeyInput.ts         Trimmed to soft/attached keyboard keys: no
                              function keys, no Win32 or Kitty input modes.

